other way, but it does not working. ... Elena_Salt September 16, 2025, 5:39am 22\n\nJust a quick update: The bank had no problems canceling the payment, and you can also easily delete your account through OpenAI’s own site. However, you can never use the same email address again. I’m planning to delete mine in 9 days, right before the next transaction is scheduled.\n\nmooky April 8, 2025, 8:06pm 18\n\nThis happened to me and I solved it. If you subscribe on your iPhone app (maybe Android too?) - you cannot cancel on the website, e.g chatgpt dot com - this makes sense because Apple Payment Systems are used for all iOS transactions - there is likely no way to sign up on iPhone and Cancel on web. You need to Cancel where you signed up.\n\nJimmy_Hendrix June 12, 2025, 8:59am 19\n\nthe keep moving it.. for me now it was here:\n\nimage1973×1104 153 KB\n\nJeremy_Meek July 24, 2025, 12:40am 20\n\nthe button doesnt give me no popup and i tried on firefox, chrome, n edge.\n\nI look at it with inspect\n\nManage\n\nI literally force the data-state to open and still nothing shows. these people are evil in my eyes. so I just start deleted my account and am going to a competitor. wont ever get another dollar from me with these evil practices.\n\nsteve10 July 31, 2025, 2:52pm 21\n\nOK, Try this: it worked for me (eventually found it…)\nClick on your profile icon in the bottom-left corner.\nClick on Settings\nClick on the Account tab on the left\nClick on the Manage button\nAn option (in red) to cancel the plan will appear\nClick on it and and away you go.\nAll went OK for me…\n\nElena_Salt September 16, 2025, 5:39am 22\n\nSubscription chatGPT1667×911 121 KB\n\nSettings then Account\n\nM.B_Febrianus October 14, 2025, 4:13am 23\n\nalready try like you did, still i cannot cancel my subscription, no cancel subscription menu.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nOpenAI Codex team hosts Reddit AMA: 17th September 2025 - Codex - OpenAI Developer